# 🔹 Dry Run (Step-by-Step Explanation)

### Input

```
A = ABCBDAB
B = BDCABA
```

Length:

```
m = 7
n = 6
```

DP Table Size:

```
(7 + 1) × (6 + 1) = 8 × 7
```

