# 🔹 Rule Used in DP

| Condition        | Formula Used                           |
| ---------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| Characters match | dp[i][j] = 1 + dp[i-1][j-1]            |
| No match         | dp[i][j] = max(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1]) |

---

# 🔹 Final DP Table

```
      ""  B  D  C  A  B  A
   -------------------------
"" |  0  0  0  0  0  0  0
A  |  0  0  0  0  1  1  1
B  |  0  1  1  1  1  2  2
C  |  0  1  1  2  2  2  2
B  |  0  1  1  2  2  3  3
D  |  0  1  2  2  2  3  3
A  |  0  1  2  2  3  3  4
B  |  0  1  2  2  3  4  4
```

---

# 🔹 How Length is Found

Bottom-right cell:

```
dp[7][6] = 4
```

So,

```
Length of LCS = 4
```

---

# 🔹 Backtracking (How LCS String is Found)

Start from bottom-right:

1. B vs A → Not match → Move left
2. B vs B → Match → Add B
3. Move diagonal
4. A vs A → Match → Add A
5. Move diagonal
6. D vs C → Not match → Move up
7. B vs C → Not match → Move up
8. C vs C → Match → Add C
9. Move diagonal
10. B vs B → Match → Add B

Collected (reverse order):

```
B A C B
```

Reverse it:

```
BCAB
```

(Note: BCBA is also correct. Multiple valid answers possible.)

